#. i18n: file: powersaveConfig.ui:196
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, PoweredIdleTime)
#. i18n: file: powersaveConfig.ui:415
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, BatteryIdleTime)
#: rc.cpp:66 rc.cpp:147
msgid ""
"To prevent data loss or other damage, you can have the system suspend or "
"hibernate, so you do not accidentally run out of battery power. Configure "
"the number of minutes below which the machine will run the configured action."
msgstr ""
"Dat Systeem lett sik för't Verhöden vun Datenverlust oder anner Schadens "
"utsetten oder infreren, dormit de Batterie nich ut Versehn leddig warrt. "
"Nerrn laat sik de Minuten fastleggen, na de de Reekner de fastleggt Akschoon "
"utföhrt."

